{"id":"30dcc2d1e76ab8d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Measure Completion","display":"df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion — ZFC Measure9 Measure Completion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion — ZFC Measure9 Measure Completion","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion — ZFC Measure9 Measure Completion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^\\mu\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma^\\mu\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\mu\\in[0,\\infty]^{\\Sigma^\\mu}\">\\(\\overline\\mu\\in[0,\\infty]^{\\Sigma^\\mu}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MeasureCompletion}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MeasureCompletion}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}measure\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MeasureCompletion}_S(\\Sigma^\\mu,\\overline\\mu;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\n\\Sigma^\\mu\n=\\left\\{E\\subseteq X:\\exists A,Z\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\bigl(\\mu(Z)=0\\land ((E\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus E))\\subseteq Z\\bigr)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\overline\\mu)=\\Sigma^\\mu\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\overline\\mu,X,\\Sigma^\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\Sigma^\\mu\\;\\forall A,Z\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\left(\n\\mu(Z)=0\\land ((E\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus E))\\subseteq Z\n\\to \\overline\\mu(E)=\\mu(A)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}measure\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MeasureCompletion}_S(\\Sigma^\\mu,\\overline\\mu;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\n\\Sigma^\\mu\n=\\left\\{E\\subseteq X:\\exists A,Z\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\bigl(\\mu(Z)=0\\land ((E\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus E))\\subseteq Z\\bigr)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\overline\\mu)=\\Sigma^\\mu\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\overline\\mu,X,\\Sigma^\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\Sigma^\\mu\\;\\forall A,Z\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\left(\n\\mu(Z)=0\\land ((E\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus E))\\subseteq Z\n\\to \\overline\\mu(E)=\\mu(A)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed value of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\mu(E)\">\\(\\overline\\mu(E)\\)</span> is independent of the witnessing\nmeasurable set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> because two such witnesses differ by a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-null set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)$, $\\Sigma^\\mu\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)$, and $\\overline\\mu\\in[0,\\infty]^{\\Sigma^\\mu}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^\\mu\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline\\mu\\in[0,\\infty]^{\\Sigma^\\mu}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MeasureCompletion}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}measure\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MeasureCompletion}_S(\\Sigma^\\mu,\\overline\\mu;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\n\\Sigma^\\mu\n=\\left\\{E\\subseteq X:\\exists A,Z\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\bigl(\\mu(Z)=0\\land ((E\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus E))\\subseteq Z\\bigr)\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\overline\\mu)=\\Sigma^\\mu\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\overline\\mu,X,\\Sigma^\\mu)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\Sigma^\\mu\\;\\forall A,Z\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\left(\n\\mu(Z)=0\\land ((E\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus E))\\subseteq Z\n\\to \\overline\\mu(E)=\\mu(A)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\overline\\mu(E)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":1476,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2676","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion.md|58-df-zfc-measure9-measure-completion]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728"]}